        "reason": "Names all three SLA figures (99.9%, 99.91%, 99.95%), identifies the CEO’s prior customer commitment and VP Engineering’s explicit refusal, and treats missing required Engineering approval as a hard release blocker. Also captures the lack of on-prem uptime data, six-month pilot requirement, and financial-penalty exposure."
